      "cooked": "<p>Hello everyone,</p>\n<p>I am having a little problem on purchase invoice.</p>\n<p>I have a two VAT on one invoice 7% and 0% but after set it from tutorial about taxes on youtube from Frappe on submit get error \" Tax should be 7.0% of the base amount<br>\n<strong>Note:</strong> To correct base amount, fill in Tax Base Amount.\" Below my setup do i missing anything?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/1/91f5ce9a4ca33e0239ab885318b4dbace1579eae.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/91f5ce9a4ca33e0239ab885318b4dbace1579eae\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/1/91f5ce9a4ca33e0239ab885318b4dbace1579eae.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kPdS5p3mMIGKVCsWC5GIxiGhCZU\" width=\"474\" height=\"121\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">474×121 6.21 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/a/7a423ddb44970e23115aea20a5f707e0ac506e00.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7a423ddb44970e23115aea20a5f707e0ac506e00\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/a/7a423ddb44970e23115aea20a5f707e0ac506e00_2_420x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hryaKEiEQLNVFXhCtJ8Ni9qw9m8\" width=\"420\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/a/7a423ddb44970e23115aea20a5f707e0ac506e00_2_420x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/a/7a423ddb44970e23115aea20a5f707e0ac506e00_2_630x750.png 1