/f4a28afae5df96b8aea163783699f5f2cdb63282\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/4/f4a28afae5df96b8aea163783699f5f2cdb63282_2_690x258.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"yU8KspEPAMqW4cg40EV53TPGEng\" width=\"690\" height=\"258\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/4/f4a28afae5df96b8aea163783699f5f2cdb63282_2_690x258.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/4/f4a28afae5df96b8aea163783699f5f2cdb63282_2_1035x387.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/4/f4a28afae5df96b8aea163783699f5f2cdb63282.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1146×429 33.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/6/460b907954266bb26f7e55cca12a7d2fb0779693.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/460b907954266bb26f7e55cca12a7d2fb0779693\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/6/460b907954266bb26f7e55cca12a7d2fb0779693_2_690x271.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"9ZEcmE6NS1Njw4pOLlzB49E0LNp\" width=\"690\" height=\"271\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/6/460b907954266bb26f7e55cca12a7d2fb0779693_2_690x271.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/6/460b907954266bb26f7e55cca12a7d2fb0779693_2_1035x406.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/6/460b907954266bb26f7e55cca12a7d2fb0779693.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=