      "cooked": "<p>this is how i set it first but have this message anyway :</p>\n<h4><a name=\"p-477229-h-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-477229-h-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a></h4>\n<p>Message</p>\n<p>Tax should be 7.0% of the base amount<br>\n<strong>Note:</strong> To correct base amount, fill in Tax Base Amount.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/9/5952d272747f82761ac816c2da37e0aaa2cce8b9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5952d272747f82761ac816c2da37e0aaa2cce8b9\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/9/5952d272747f82761ac816c2da37e0aaa2cce8b9_2_359x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"cKbWiyTax9LsMlw2ylbZJFwvefT\" width=\"359\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/9/5952d272747f82761ac816c2da37e0aaa2cce8b9_2_359x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/9/5952d272747f82761ac816c2da37e0aaa2cce8b9_2_538x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/9/5952d272747f82761ac816c2da37e0aaa2cce8b9_2_718x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">820×1140 56.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\nOn tax Breakup it assign correct tax but on submit its complain, but if exactly same but with item only 7% is ok, and as well only 0% is ok too same setup</p>",
